  "Pares com o reator Sabatier para recuperar O₂ do CO₂.": "Pairs with the Sabatier reactor to recover O₂ from CO₂.",
  "Particulados suspensos, incluindo poeira com perclorato": "Suspended particulates, including perchlorate dust",
